Source: task-ai-desktop
Section: tasks
Priority: optional
Maintainer: AI Workspace Lab <ai-workspace-lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/ai-workspace-lab/ai-desktop

Package: task-ai-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends:
 icewm,
 dbus-x11,
 xdg-utils,
 xdg-user-dirs,
 x11-utils,
 x11-xserver-utils,
 xauth,
 ca-certificates,
 fontconfig,
 fonts-noto-core,
 fonts-noto-cjk,
 fonts-noto-color-emoji,
 hicolor-icon-theme,
 adwaita-icon-theme,
 gvfs,
 gvfs-backends,
 xfce4-terminal,
 thunar,
 thunar-volman,
 libqt6core6t64,
 libqt6gui6,
 libqt6qml6,
 libqt6quick6,
 libqt6quickcontrols2-6,
 libqt6widgets6,
 qt6-qpa-plugins,
 libxcb1,
 xdock,
 xlaunch,
 chromium | firefox-esr,
 ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: xorg, lightdm
Description: lightweight AI Workspace X11 desktop task
 Meta-package for an ICEWM-based AI desktop with XDock, XLaunch, a terminal,
 Thunar, and Chromium or Firefox. It supports desktop, VPS, and container
 profiles through the companion task-ai-desktop-vps and
 task-ai-desktop-container packages.

Package: task-ai-desktop-vps
Architecture: all
Depends: task-ai-desktop, xvfb, x11vnc, dbus-x11, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: novnc, websockify
Description: VPS profile for task-ai-desktop
 Adds the Xvfb and X11VNC pieces needed to run the ICEWM AI desktop on a
 headless VPS without a physical display or GPU.

Package: task-ai-desktop-container
Architecture: all
Depends: task-ai-desktop, xvfb, x11vnc, dbus-x11, tini, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: novnc, websockify
Description: container profile for task-ai-desktop
 Adds Xvfb, X11VNC, D-Bus and init setup for running the AI desktop inside an
 OCI container without systemd; noVNC and websockify provide optional browser
 access.
